<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">- Benamanga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Vabulaniya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa kwa Vabulaniya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Vabulaniya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Vabu</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Vabulaniya</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kiganulo kya Vabulaniya ndi baluwa lya kuvagangamicha numbula vanu, iwonesa Yesu peatimisile makani gamonga ga uvichi lwa Liagano lya Dahila, baluwa iyi isimbilwe ngita madaliko. Mukiganulo iki kya Vabulaniya kuna makani kuhuma muliagano lya dahila elufu sitini fyefiwonesa wachi Yesu peatimisile uvichi na kasi cha mtekechi mkomi va Kiyawudi. Kuhumila na ilyo, kiganulo iki kisimbilwe neke kuvagangamicha Vayawudi vevamudikiye Kilisito. Kiganulo iki kya Vabulaniya kiwonesa kuva Yesu atimilise kasi cha malagilicho ga Nguluvi geamgavile Musa neke Vatekechi va Nguluvi vabihile kwendelela kangi kuhecha usembe va kunyanya. Kwakuva Yesu akali usembe va kuhecha sambi chonda, ikagitilwe mala yimwi na kwa figono fyonda. Vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito va chipindi ichi viwesa ndeni kugangamichwa numbula mukiganulo iki kya Vabulaniya neke vaendelele kumfwatila Yesu Kilisito yeakutugita nefwe tumudikile Nguluvi na kuendelela kumudikila mwene. Sula lya 12.2.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwihela munu yeichela ani yeasimbile kiganulo iki kya Vabulaniya, ila vakwimba volofu vilonga pagati lya ava vadatu iwesekana vasimbile mnjagila Paulo awu Luka awu Balinaba. Kangi seimanyika chipindi cha kusimbilwa kiganulo iki ila volofu vidikila kisimbilwe kabula lya mwaka va sabini baada lya kubabwa Yesu Kilisito. Mwani va Yelusalemu uhanangilwe mumwaka va sabini baada lya kubabwa Yesu Kilisito, ila msimbila va baluwa iyi akuhumulila ngita mwani va Yelusalemu wave kuhanangwa. Kiganulo iki kya Vabulaniya kisimbilwe mumwani va Roma. Sula lya 13.24 na iwesekana kuva ichumbile mulipinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito myolofu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegagehe</para>
  <para style="io">Msimbila iwonesa kuva Yesu Kilisito ndi ngiba na mkomi kuchumba vavichi na vandumindumi va Nguluvi. Sula lya 1.1—4.13.</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi iendelela kuwonesa kasi lya Yesu ndi ngiba na mkomi kuchumba vatekechi vevagita kasi mukaye lya Yelusalemu. Sula lya 4.14—7.28.</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi iwonesa kasi lya Yesu ndi ngiba na yene ukomi kuchumba yila malagilicho ga Nguluvi yeamgavile Musa. Sula lya 8.1—10.31.</para>
  <para style="io">Peasindile kuganula kuva Yesu ndi ngiba na mkomi kwa kila kinu, nondee msimbila iendelela kulagicha gamonga gya makani geging'ang'wa kugitwa. Sula lya 10.32—13.17.</para>
  <para style="io">Msimbila isinda kusimba baluwa lyake kwa kuvagangamicha numbula vanu na kuvahungila vanu. Sula lya 13.18-25.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="s">Nguluvi iywanga na vanu kuchumbila mwana vake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />Dahila, Nguluvi akalongile na vagogolo vetu kuchumbila vavichi vake mala chongofu na kwa ng'asi chongofu, <verse eid="HEB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" />ila mufigono ifi fya mwiso ilonga na nefwe kuchumbila Mwana vake. Kuchumbila mwene, Nguluvi akawumbile inyi na amuhaguwe neke finu fyonda fiveche fyake. <verse eid="HEB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" />Mwana ndi lung'ali lwa ukomi va Nguluvi na iwonesa kuva Nguluvi peagehe. Igita finu fyonda fiveche pamwi ngita pefigehe kwa luchowo lwake lwelugehe na ludali. Peamalile kuvang'alicha na kuvahechelela vanu sambi chawo, akahelele kukala ukoya kuluhano mulubali lwa luwoko lwa ndewo lwa Nguluvi.<verse eid="HEB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukomi va Mwana va Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" />Ndeni, Mwana va Nguluvi ndi mkomi kuchumba vandumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi, ngita litawa lyeagavilwe na Nguluvi liwonesa mwene ndi mkomi kuchumba vonda. <verse eid="HEB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" />Kwakuva Nguluvi seakamlongiye ng'odo ndumindumi vake yumwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">“Veve ndi Mwana vangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">neng'uli ndilonga nene ndivechile Daada vako.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">Nguluvi seakalongile ng'odo na ndumindumi yeyonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">“Nene dandivecha Daada vake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">na mwene daivecha Mwana vangu.”<verse eid="HEB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" />Ila Nguluvi peamlagiche Mwana vake mlongola mkigosi muinyi akalongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:6">“Ndumindumi vangu vonda vakuluhano vamgundamile mwene.”<verse eid="HEB 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />Ila kwa njowo cha ndumindumi vake va kuluhano akalongile kuva,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:7">“Ndikuvagalambula ndumindumi vangu kuvecha lukala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:7">na vanyigendwa vangu va kuluhano kuvecha lwenge lwa lyoto.”<verse eid="HEB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />Ila kwa Mwana vake, Nguluvi akalongile kuva,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:8">“Veve Nguluvi ung'achale vako seusila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:8">Veve dautavala ngita peing'ang'wa.<verse eid="HEB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />Veve ukela magito gyeging'ang'wa na kuvipila unjanganifu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:9">Kwakuva Nguluvi, Nguluvi vako akuhaguwe na kukubaka mafuta manofu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:9">neke uveche mkomi na kugavilwa lukeduko na uginyange,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:9">kuchumba vayago vonda.”<verse eid="HEB 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />Baho akalongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:10">“Mtwa veve dahila ukawumbile inyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:10">na kwa mawoko gyako ukawumbile luhano.<verse eid="HEB 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />Finu ifi dafiyaganika, ila veve dawisigala mbepali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:11">fyonda dafisakala ngita myenda.<verse eid="HEB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />Daukugibandabanda ngita koti veusakiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">na chene dachigalambilwa ngita mwenda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">Ila veve ndi yula yula mbepali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">na miyaka gyako dasegivecha na mwiso.”<verse eid="HEB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />Nguluvi seakamlongiye ata yumwi va ndumindumi vake va kuluhano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:13">“Wikale lubali lwangu lwa luwoko lwa ndewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:13">mbaka ndivavike vachindwama vako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:13">vaveche kigoda kya kuvikila magulu.”<verse eid="HEB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" />Wuli, ndumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi nde vaani? Ndumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi ndi muhe vevakumgumbanikila Nguluvi na vevilagichwa kuvatanga vala daviwanuka ulowola.<verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="s">Ulowola ukomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />Ndeni, twing'ang'wa kugakolela hilo gyonda gyetupulike, neke tubihile kugayaga. <verse eid="HEB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" />Unanzi wula wevagavilwe vagogolo vetu na vandumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi ukali va undakyene, ndena munu yeyonda yeaseufwatile awu kwidikila ihigwa ngita peing'ang'wa. <verse eid="HEB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" />Nefwe twilowoka wuli ngita dasetukwidikila ulowola ugu ukomi? Tandi, Mtwa yumwene ndeakavangile kulanducha ulowola, kangi na vala vevakapulike vakatulongiye kuva unanzi ugu ndi undakyene. <verse eid="HEB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" />Ndeni ndeni Nguluvi akawonesile kuva ulowola ugo ndi undakyene kwa kugita kimanyilo na umanyitu molofu. Na kuvagavila vanu fupo lya Muhe va Nguluvi ngita peakeliye mwene.<verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi yeakuvalongocha vanu muulowola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5" />Nguluvi seakavavikile vandumindumi vake va kuluhano vatavale inyi yeikwacha, ndi inyi yetuiywangila makani gyake. <verse eid="HEB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6" />Ila masimbo gya Nguluvi pono pangi gilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:6">“Munu nde ani mbaka umuhochile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:6">Na mwana va munu ndi ani mbaka umulolele?<verse eid="HEB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />Ukamgitile aveche mdodo kuchumba vandumindumi va kuluhano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:7">umufwalisile ingela lya ukomi na uginyange,<verse eid="HEB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />ukamgitile atavale finu fyonda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 2:8">Ichelwa kuva Nguluvi akamgitile munu atavale finu fyonda, seakalekile ata kinu kimwi. Ila nondee setwilola munu itavala finu fyonda. <verse eid="HEB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" />Ila tukumlola Yesu yeakagitilwe kwa chipindi chidodo akagitilwe kuvecha mdodo kuchumba vandumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi, neke kwa usangi va Nguluvi afuwe kwakuva lya vanu vonda. Kwakuva lya kugudiswa na kufuwa kwa mwene. <verse eid="HEB 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />Ikamkelesile Nguluvi yeawumbile finu fyonda na kuvivika unofu finu fyonda, akamkamilise Yesu kwa ng'asi lya magudo, neke avalete vanu volofu muukomi vake. Kwakuva Yesu ndi yeakuvalowa vanu.<verse eid="HEB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" />Yesu akuvang'alicha vanu sambi chawo, mwene pamwi na vala vevang'alichwe, vonda vagehe na Daada yumwi. Ndena, Yesu seiwona nyoni kuvakemela avo, vakolo vake. <verse eid="HEB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" />Ngita pealongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:12">“Veve Nguluvi dandikuvalongela vakolo vangu magito gyeugagitile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:12">na dandikunjuma pala pevatang'anila.” <verse eid="HEB 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />Ndeni ndeni akalongile, “Dandikumuhuvilila Nguluvi.” Ilonga kangi, “Nene ndigehe baha pamwi na vana veanigaviye Nguluvi vaveche vana vangu.”<verse eid="HEB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14" />Suwe, kwa ndeni vana avo vevagehe na muvili na danda, Yesu yumwene akachile akiva ngita vene. Akagitile ndena neke kwa ng'asi lya kufuwa kwamwene, amuhanangile Setani yeagehe na ludali lwa kufuwa, <verse eid="HEB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15" />na ndeni akavalekele vala vevakali vasutu mukwikala kwawo konda, vakali vasutu kwa kogofya kufuwa. <verse eid="HEB 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" />Kwakuva igehe wachi kuva mwene seakachile kuvatanga vandumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi, ila akachile kukitanga ulelo va Ibulahimu. <verse eid="HEB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" />Ndena, ikamng'ang'ile awane na vakolo vake kwa kila kinu, neke aveche Mtekechi mkomi yeadikilwe na munya lusungu kwa kumugumbanikila Nguluvi, neke vanu vahechelwe sambi chawo. <verse eid="HEB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" />Kwakuva mwene peagechilwe na kugudiswa, suwe, ivesa kuvatanga vala vevigechwa.<verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi mkomi kuchumba Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />Ndeni, vakolo vangu yemukemeliwe muveche vana va Nguluvi, muhochele Yesu yealagichilwe na Nguluvi, aveche mnjagila na mtekechi mkomi va ludikilo lwetu. <verse eid="HEB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" />Mwene akali mdikilwa kwa Nguluvi, yeamhaguwe kugita kasi lyake, ngita Musa peakali mdikila kuvakumbanikila vanu vote va Isilaeli, avo nde kaye lya Nguluvi. <verse eid="HEB 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3" />Ila Yesu ing'ang'wa uginyange mkomi kuchumba Musa ngita fila mgelanicha peinjumwa hilo kuchumba kaye yene. <verse eid="HEB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4" />Ndakyene kila kaye igelanichwa na munu tunga ila Nguluvi ndi mgelanicha va finu fyonda. <verse eid="HEB 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" />Musa akali mndakyene va kila kinu ngita mchulila kwa vanu vonda va Isilaeli mukaye lya Nguluvi na akalongile njowo dailonga Nguluvi pambele. <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" />Ila Kilisito, mwene ndi mwana mndakyene va kila kinu, yeakuvalongocha vanu va kaye lya Nguluvi. Na nefwe nde vanu avo kaya lya Nguluvi, ngita hela datukwendelela mbaka mwiso kuva vagangamala na kwidumbila mumakani gala getuhuvilila.<verse eid="HEB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutulula kwa vanu va Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7" />Ndena, ngita peilonga Muhe va Nguluvi mumasimbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:7">“Ngita, mukipulika lichwi lyake neng'uli,<verse eid="HEB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8" />mubihile kuvecha na kidada ngita vagogolo venu pevamkanile kumginya Nguluvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:8">ngita kigono kila pevakali vakunigecha ukoya kudasi.<verse eid="HEB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />Ukoya nde vagogolo venu vakali vakundigecha na kundilola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:9">ata ngita vakalolile magito gyangu kwa miyaka alubaini.<verse eid="HEB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />Kwa ndeni, vakandigitile ndivipe na ndikalongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:10">‘Vanu ava ndivanjanganifu figono fyonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:10">na valema kudikila malagilicho gyangu.’<verse eid="HEB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />Ndeni, ndikavipile na kwilapa ndikalongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:11">‘Dasevikwingila ng'odo muinyi yeandikuvagavila vatulule!’”<verse eid="HEB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />Vakolo vangu, mwilolele abihile kuvecha munu pagati lwenu yeagehe na mahocho manjanganifu, yesedikila na kuvagita vanu vayinenge na Nguluvi yeagehe wumi. <verse eid="HEB 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" />Ila mwigangamiche mwavene kila kigono neke kubihile kuvecha na munu mugati lyenu yeigitwa mkangafu kwa kuchangwa na sambi. <verse eid="HEB 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" />Kwakuva nefwe tuvechile kinu kimwi mkwa kwiwunga na Kilisito, ikiva ngita twikolela luhuvililo lyetu lyetukali nalyo pamwandi mbaka mwiso.<verse eid="HEB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" />Ngita pegilonga masimbo gya Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">“Ngita neng'uli mukuipulika lichwi lwa Nguluvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">mubihile kugita numbula chenu kuvecha ng'angafu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">ngita pevakagitile vagogolo pevamukanile Nguluvi.”<verse eid="HEB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />Ndi va ani avo yevapulike lichwi lwa Nguluvi na vakamkanile? Wuli, sevala vonda vevakalongochwe na Musa kuhuma ku Misili? <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" />Wuli, ndi vaani vevamuvipise Nguluvi kwa miyaka alubaini? Ndi vala vevakagitile sambi na kufuwa ukoya kudasi? <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />Nguluvi pealapile, akalapile ndeni, “Dasevikwingila pono pangu pakutulula” Akavalongile va ani? Akali akuvalongela vala vonda vevakakanile kumwidikila. <verse eid="HEB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />Suwe, twilola sevawesile kwingila pono pakutulula kwakuva vakakanile kudikila.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />Suwe, kwakuva gala gealongile Nguluvi, makani ga kwingila pono pakutulula, gave gagehe, tugangamale neke munu yeyonda mugati lyenu abihile kulemuwa kwingila pono pakutulula. <verse eid="HEB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Kwakuva Njowo nofu idalikilwe kwa nefwe ngita fila peidalikilwe kwa avo vanu va dahila. Ila unanzi ugo seukavatangile kinu, kwakuva vakaupulike ila sevakauwanuke kwa kwidikila. <verse eid="HEB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" />Ila nondee, nefwe yetudikiye tukwingila pono pakutulula. Ngita pealongile Nguluvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:3">“Vakandivipise na ndikalapile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:3">‘Sevikwingila ng'odo pono lyangu pakutulula.’”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 4:3">Nguluvi akalongile ago peasindile kasi lya kuwumba inyi yonda. <verse eid="HEB 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" />Kwakuva, pono tunga Mumasimbo gya Nguluvi gilonga kutigila kigono kya saba, “Nguluvi akamalile kasi chake chonda na kutulula kigono kya saba.” <verse eid="HEB 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" />Pono baho pasimbilwe kangi, “Dasevikwingila pono pangu pakutulula.” <verse eid="HEB 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />Suwe, vanu vala pevapulike Njowo nofu pamwandi sevaingiye pala pono pakutulula, kwakuva vakakanile kwidikila. Ila jangila lya kwingila pono pakutulula yave igehe. <verse eid="HEB 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" />Nguluvi akavikile kigono kingi kyekikemelwa, “Neng'uli.” Akalongile kangi njowo icho pambele, kuchumbila Dawudi ngita Masimbo gya Nguluvi pegilonga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 4:7">“Ngita neng'uli mupulika lichwi lwa Nguluvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:7">mubihile kuvecha na kidada.” <verse eid="HEB 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" />Ngita Yoshuwa ngaavalongocha vanu avo pono pa kutulula ngita pealongiye Nguluvi, suwe Nguluvi ngasealongile makani gya kigono kingi kya pambele. <verse eid="HEB 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />Ndeni, kwave kusigaliye kigono kya kutulula kwa vanu va Nguluvi. <verse eid="HEB 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" />Kwakuva kila yeakwingila pono pakutulula pa Nguluvi daatulula kuhuma mukasi lyake ngita Nguluvi peatulule peamalile kasi lyake. <verse eid="HEB 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />Suwe, tugangamale kwingila pono baho pakutulula, neke abihile kuvecha munu yeyonda mugati lyenu abihile kuyaga kwa kukana kwidikila ngita pevagitile vao.<verse eid="HEB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" />Luchowo lwa Nguluvi ligehe na wumi na ludali, ndi ling'ali kuchumba lipanga leligehe na mang'ali lyeliwesa kudumula kuno na kuno, na kwingila na kunengecha numbula na muhe, mbaka pale pefitang'anila fiwungo fya muvili na uloto. Luchowo ulo ugubutula natilo na mahocho gya numbula cha vanu. <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />Ndeni, kuhela kiwumbe kyokyonda kyekifyamila pautalo lya Nguluvi, ila kila kinu kigehe wachi pautalo lyake na kwa mwene datung'ang'wa kulonga gyonda gyetugitile.<verse eid="HEB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi Mtekechi Mkomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />Kwakuva tugehe na Mtekechi Mkomi yeingile kuluhano kwa Nguluvi, uyu nde Yesu Mwana va Nguluvi. Suwe, tung'ang'wa tukolele hilo ludikilo lwetu. <verse eid="HEB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" />Uyu Mtekechi Mkomi vetu akutuwonela lusungu usosuvafu vetu, mwene akagechilwe ngita nefwe kwa ng'asi cholofu ila seakagitile sambi. <verse eid="HEB 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" />Suwe, tuhegelele ngajila wogofi kigoda kya ung'achale kya Nguluvi yeagehe msanzi, neke twanuke lusungu na usangi va kututanga chipindi cha utatala.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />Kila mtekechi mkomi ihagulwa pagati pa vanu vake na kumugumbanikila Nguluvi ngajila lya vanu, neke kuvahechela usembe na fupo neke Nguluvi avahogeche sambi chawo. <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" />Mtekechi mkomi iwesa kuvatanga vanu pevagita sambi, ila mwene ndi msosuvafu, kwakuva mwene igita sambi. <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" />Kwa ndena, yumwene ndi msosovafu ing'ang'wa kuhecha usembe sekwakuva lya vanu, ila kwakuva lya sambi chake mwene. <verse eid="HEB 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" />Kwahela munu yeiwesa kwigita mwene kuvecha mtekechi mkomi. Nguluvi mwene nde akumkemela munu kuva mtekechi mkomi ngita peakali Haluni.<verse eid="HEB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />Ndeni ndeni, Kilisito seakwigitile kuvecha mtekechi mkomi, ila Nguluvi akamlongiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:5">“Veve ndi Mwana vangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:5">neng'uli nene ndivechile Daada vako.”<verse eid="HEB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />Ndeni ndeni pono pangi mumasimbo gya Nguluvi gilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:6">“Uvecha mtekechi mbepali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:6">mukasi lya utekechi va Melikisedeki.”<verse eid="HEB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />Yesu peakali akwikala baha mu inyi, akamsukile Nguluvi na kumvembela kwa mahochi, kwakuva akali na umwimike va kumulowa mukufuwa, kwakuva akali akumginya hilo Nguluvi, ndeni Nguluvi akampulikicha. <verse eid="HEB 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />Ata ngita akali Mwana va Nguluvi, akayiwulaniche kwidikila kwa ng'asi lya magudo. <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9" />Peamalile kasi yealagilichwe na Nguluvi, akali luvangilo lwa ulowa va mbepali kwa vala vevakumwidikila, <verse eid="HEB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10" />na Nguluvi akamhaguwe kuvecha mtekechi mkomi ngita peakali Melikisedeki.<verse eid="HEB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lulakililo lwa kuleka ludikilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />Tugehe na gyolofu gya kulonga pakyanya lya utekechi ugu, ila seupefu kuvahumulila, kwakuva nyenye sevapefu va kuchela. <verse eid="HEB 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" />Kwa chipindi ichi mukang'ang'ilwe kuvecha vawulanichi, kwakuva figono fyolofu fikachumbile ila nyenye wave mkela munu avaulaniche mawulanichi gya pamwandi njowo cha Nguluvi. Nondee badili kuliya kyakula kingafu nyenye mwisaka kukong'a mavele. <verse eid="HEB 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />Yeyonda yeikong'a mavele hela ave mwana, kwakuva seichela manofu vala manjanganifu. <verse eid="HEB 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" />Ila vanu vevakangie yende veviliya kyakulya kikangafu, kwakuva vanu avo vawulanichwe kuchela manofu na manjanganifu.<verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1" />Suwe, tugaleke gala mawulanicho gyetukali tuwulanichwa petukali setuchela kinu kyokyonda kukyanya lya Kilisito. Ndeni, twendelele kutalo kwa gala gegikangiye na sekwendelela kugaywangila gala mumawulanicho ga pamwandi kukyanya lya magito segikumkelesa Nguluvi na kukyanya lya kumdikila Nguluvi, <verse eid="HEB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2" />mawulanicho gya ubatiso na kuvasukila kwa kuvavikila mawoko na mawulanicho gya uchulubuko na gya higilo lwa mbepali. <verse eid="HEB 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />Kwa kugita ndeni, datuendelela kukula na kukangala muludikilo, Nguluvi daikela.<verse eid="HEB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4" />Kwakuva vanu vala vevachele undakyene va Nguluvi, vala vevawanuke finu fino kuhuma kuluhano kwa ng'asi lya Muhe va Nguluvi, <verse eid="HEB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5" />na vakuchela unofu kuva luchowo lwa Nguluvi ndi nofu na kangi vakuchela unofu ludali lwa lutavala lwa Nguluvi muinyi yeikwacha, <verse eid="HEB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" />na vanu avo vakailekile ludikilo lwao, seiwesekana kuvapilusa avo vahongeche kangi. Avo vavene nde ngita vakumuvamba kangi Mwana va Nguluvi na kumgavila nyoni pautalo lwa vanu.<verse eid="HEB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Nguluvi akafunyile mgunda weukwanuka ndonya yeitonya chipindi chonda na kumelecha mimelo ginofu, ikumtanga mgima, lyelifunyilwe na Nguluvi. <verse eid="HEB 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" />Ila mgunda weumelicha mihomi na misapi, seukumtanga kinu mgima, igehe pepi kukotoliwa na Nguluvi na pambele unyanywa lyoto.<verse eid="HEB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Ila vakolo vangu, ata ngita ndivasimbiliye kwa njowo mang'ali, ata ndeni nene ndigehe na undakyene kuva mugita magito manofu gegiwonesa kuva mulowoliwe. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" />Nguluvi ndi msanzi na seasemuwe kasi yemugitile awu lukelo lwenu lwemuwonesile mwene kwa kuvatanga vanu kangi muendelela kuvatanga vanu vake. <verse eid="HEB 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />Nefwe tung'ang'a kila munu mugati lyenu awonese lugangamalo mbaka mwiso, neke gala gyemukugahuvilila gahumile. <verse eid="HEB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />Suwe, setukela nyenye muveche vagata, ila muveche ngita vala vevadikila na kuhuvilila na kwanuka gala gyeajangile Nguluvi.<verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jangile lya Nguluvi ndi lya undakyene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13" />Nguluvi peamjangile Ibulahimu na akayilapile kwa litawa lyake mwene, kwakuva kuhela yeagehe mkomi kuchumba mwene. <verse eid="HEB 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14" />Nguluvi akalongile, “Ndakyene dandikunemela na dandikugavila ulelo wolofu.” <verse eid="HEB 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Ibulahimu akachindile kwa luhuvilo na akawanuke kila kyeakalongiwe na Nguluvi. <verse eid="HEB 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" />Vanu pevikwilapa, vilapa kwa munu yumwi yeagehe mkomi kuchumba vao na kwilapila kuwonesa kuva kila kyekilongelwa ndakyene na kwilapa kwisinda malumbano. <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />Nguluvi akawonesile jangile kwa kwilapa na kwa ndeni akavawonise wachi vala yeavikile navo jangile seigalambucha jangile lyake. <verse eid="HEB 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" />Suwe, Nguluvi akagitile finu ifi fivili jangila na kilapo, akagitile finu ifi fivili neke atugangamiche numbula. Nefwe vetumuheleliye neke tukolele luhuvililo lweuvikile pautalo lyetu. <verse eid="HEB 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19" />Tugehe na luhuvililo ngita nanga yeikolela meli lya uwumi vetu. Luhuvililo ulo lukwingila mbaka pono pala pepahaguliwe na Nguluvi ukoya kuluhano. <verse eid="HEB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20" />Yesu mwene akatulonguwe kwingila mula, kwakuva lya nefwe na akali mtekechi mkomi mbepali ngita peakali Melikisedeki.<verse eid="HEB 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="s">Mtekechi Melikisedeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />Melikisedeki uyu akali ng'achale va mwani va Salemu na mtekechi va Nguluvi Mkomi. Ibulahimu akali ihuma kufita peakavadochile vang'achale vatai akatang'anile na Melikisedeki na mwene akamunemele, <verse eid="HEB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" />baho Ibulahimu akamgaviye pono yimwi lya chumi lya finu fyonda fyeakali nafyo. Mana lya kwanja lya litawa lya Melikisedeki ndi, “Ng'achale yeigita gyeisaka Nguluvi,” Ndeni ndeni akalii ng'achale va Salemu, mana lingi lya litawa lyake ndi, “Ng'achale va lutengamaso.” <verse eid="HEB 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />Melikisedeki akali ihela daada vala maye, vala seakali na lukolo seikali kwihela munu yeichela ababilwe pandili awu akafuwe pandili. Melikisedeki ndi ngita Mwana va Nguluvi, kwakuva daivecha mtekechi mbepali.<verse eid="HEB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />Suwe, muhoche munu uyu peakali mkomi hilo. Kuuku vetu Ibulahimu akamgaviye pono lya kyumi lya finu fyonda fyeakanyagile kufita. <verse eid="HEB 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" />Suwe, tuchela kuva kuhumila na lulagilicho lwa Musa, valelo va Lawi vakali vatekechi, ikuvasaka kunyamula pono yimwi lya chumi kuhuma kwa vanu va Isilaeli ata ngita vene vihuma muulelelo va Ibulahimu. <verse eid="HEB 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6" />Ila Melikisedeki seakali ulelo va Lawi, ila akawanuke pono lya chumi kuhuma kwa Ibulahimu, kangi akamnemele Ibulahimu, munu yeawanuke jangile kuhuma kwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="HEB 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7" />Ndi undakyene kuva munu yeakumunemela yungi, ndi mkomi kuchumba yula yeinemelwa. <verse eid="HEB 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />Kangi, vatekechi avo vevawanuka pono lya chumi, ndi vanu hela vevifuwa, ila Melikisedeki akawanuke pono lya chumi kwa Ibulahimu yeagehe wumi mbepali. <verse eid="HEB 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9" />Suwe, tuwesa kulonga kuva ata Lawi ambalye vanu va lukolo vake uwanuka pono lya chumi na mwene akahumiche pono lyake lya chumi kwa Melikisedeki kuchumbila Ibulahimu. <verse eid="HEB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10" />Kwakuva, Melikisedeki pevatang'anile na Ibulahimu, Lawi akali ave mumvili va Ibulahimu kuuku vake.<verse eid="HEB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Kwakuva, Vaisilaeli vakagavilwe malagilicho ga Musa geagavilwe na Nguluvi, malagilicho ago gigahumile na utekechi va Lawi. Ila ata ndeni utekechi ugo seukakamilike, ndeni ikang'ang'ilwe wache utekechi wungi ngita va Melikisadeki, ambavo seuwana na utekechi va Haluni. <verse eid="HEB 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />Kwakuva, utekechi peuseduka ndi ying'ang'wa na lagilicho nalyo liseduke. <verse eid="HEB 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13" />Njowo chechilongwa ndi cha Mtwa vetu, akali va likabila lingi na vala kuhela ata yumwi va likabila lyake yeakagitile kasi pakindangavala akiva mtekechi. <verse eid="HEB 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14" />Ichelwa wachi kuva mwene akababilwe mulikabila lya Yuda ambalyo Musa seakalitambuche peakali ilonga njowo cha vatekechi.<verse eid="HEB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtekechi yungi yeiwana ngita Melikisedeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />Kangi njowo ichi ndi wachi hilo, mtekechi yungi yekali ngita na Melikisedeki suwe ahumiye. <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />Mwene seakagitilwe mtekechi kwa malagicho na malagilicho gya vanu, ila akali mtekechi kwa ludali lwa uwumi vake weuhela mwiso. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" />Kwakuva, isimbilwe Mumasimbo gya Nguluvi kuva, “Veve dauvecha mtekechi mbepali, ngita peakali Melikisedeki.” <verse eid="HEB 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18" />Suwe, yila lugilicho lwa dahila lwa utekechi ikatigilichwe kwakuva ikali sosuvafu na seikawesile kututanga. <verse eid="HEB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19" />Kwakuva, malagilicho ga Musa geagavilwe na Nguluvi seikatukamilise. Ila nonde tugehe na luhuvililo linofu, kuchumbila luhuvililo ilyo twiwesa kumuhegelela Nguluvi.<verse eid="HEB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />Chipindi Valawi pevavikwa kuva vatekechi, sekukali na kilapo, ila nondee muutekechi ugu kugehe na kilapo kya Nguluvi. <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" />Ila Yesu akagitilwe mtekechi kwa kilapo, pala Nguluvi peamlongiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:21">“Mtwa alapile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:21">na mwene daseisedusa natilo lyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:21">‘Veve ndi mtekechi mbepali.’”<verse eid="HEB 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" />Kwa kwilapa ukoya, Yesu yeiwonesa undakyene lyagano linofu hilo kuchumba lila lya pamwandi.<verse eid="HEB 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Kangi, avo vatekechi vangi vakali vanu hela, ndeni chipindi chawo cha kufuwa, pechifikile vakafuweu, ndeni sevawesile kwendelela na kasi lyawo lya utekechi, ndeni nde ikagitile vaveche volofu. <verse eid="HEB 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />Ila Yesu akwikala mbepali na utekechi vake uhela mwiso. <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" />Ndena, mwene agehe na ludali chakuvalowa vonda vevakumuhelelela Nguluvi kuchumbila mwene, kwakuva mwene akwikala mbepali na kuvasukila kwa Nguluvi.<verse eid="HEB 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />Suwe, Yesu nde Mtekechi Mkomi yetukumung'ang'a, mwene ihela lupwemuko lyolyonda, yeihela sambi vala nongwa lolonda, Nguluvi akamnengile kuhuma kwa vene samabi na akamkang'iche kuluhano. <verse eid="HEB 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" />Mwene akali seiwana na vatekechi vangi, mwene sekahechile litambiko kila kigono, akivanga kuhecha litambiko lya sambi chake, kangi kwa sambi cha vanu vangi. Mwene akagitile ndeni mala yimwi hela kwakuva lya vanu vonda pala peayihechile yumwene ngita litambiko na iyi itosa kwa chipindi chonda. <verse eid="HEB 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Ila kwa kufwatila Malagilicho ga Musa geagavilwe na Nguluvi vanu vakali vivikwa vatekechi vakomi ingava vakali vigita sambi, ila pambele Nguluvi akagitile kwa kilapo akamuhagule Mwana aveche Mtekechi Mkomi, ambalye yesepwemuka na kinu kyokyonda mbepali.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi mtekechi vetu mkomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />Suwe, njowo chikomi chechitulonga nde ichi, nefwe tugehe na mtekechi mkomi yeikaliye luwoko lwa ndewo lwa kigoda kya ung'achale kya mkomi ukoya kuluhano. <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />Ukoya kuluhano mwene igita kasi lya Utekechi Ukomi, mukyama lya ukoya kuluhano ambako ndi pono pang'alile hilo, ndi kyama lyelichengilwe na Mtwa na se vanu.<verse eid="HEB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Kila mtekechi mkomi ahaguliwe kumhechela Nguluvi fupo na usembe va kunyanya. Ndeni mtekechi vetu mkomi ing'ang'wa aveche na kinu kya kuhecha. <verse eid="HEB 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />Ngita mwene ngaavechile baha painyi, ngaseavechela mtekechi ng'ono, kwakuva vagehe vatekechi vangi vihecha usembe va kunyanya ngita peging'ang'a malagilicho ga Musa geagavilwe na Nguluvi. <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" />Kasi chevakuchigita vatekechi ava chiwana na linyigi lya makani gegagehe kuluhano. Ndena, Musa pegehe igalanicha kyama, Nguluvi akamlongiye, “Lole ugelaniche kila kinu ngita peuwenesilwe peukali kukidunda.” <verse eid="HEB 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" />Ila nondee Yesu agavilwe kasi lya kitekechi yeigehe ngiba hilo kuchumba lya vene, ngita fila mnjengakaya va lyagano ngiba hilo kuchumba lila lyagano lya dahila, kwakuva lihimile nofu mulitamiko va jangila ngiba hilo.<verse eid="HEB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Ngita lila lyagano lya dahila selikali na livifyi, setung'ang'a kuvecha na lyagano lya uvili. <verse eid="HEB 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" />Ila Nguluvi akawene nongwa lya vanu, akalongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:8">“Figono fikwacha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:8">dandigita lyagano lyangu limiya na vanu va Isilaeli na vanu va Yuda.<verse eid="HEB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />Lyagano ilyi selivecha ngita lila lyendikagitile na vagogolo vao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">kigono kila pendikavalongocha unofu kuhuma muinyi lya Misili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">Kwakuva sevakalikolela lyagano lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">na nene ndikavalekile.<verse eid="HEB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />Ili ndi lyagano dandigita na vanu va Isilaeli figono fyefikwacha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">dandikuvagita vahoche malagicho gyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">na kuchisimba munumbula chawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">Nene dandivecha Nguluvi vawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">na vao davivecha vanu vangu.<verse eid="HEB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />Kuhela munu yeyonda dayeakumuwulanicha muyage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">vala munu dayeakumlongela lukolo lwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">‘Mchele Mtwa.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">Kwakuva vonda davakunichela nene</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">kuvangila mdodo mbaka mkomi.<verse eid="HEB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />Dandikuvahechela uwofu chawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:12">dasendiwiwuka kangi sambi chawo.”<verse eid="HEB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />Nguluvi peakulikemela lyagano limiya, iwonesa kuva lyagano lya kwanja ndi lya dahila na kyokyonda kya dahila kivecha kusakala na kigehe pepi kuyaga.<verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="s">Kugundamila muinyi na kugundamila kuluhano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />Suwe, lyagano lya kwanja likali na malagicho gyake gyakugundamila na kyama kyekichengilwe na vanu kya kugundamila. <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" />Pakagelanichwe kyama, kyumba kyake kya kwanja kikakemeliwe pono pang'alile hilo, mumo kukali na kindangavala kya kuvikila chibatali na mesa yeikali na mibumunda yeikavikilwe pautalo lya Nguluvi. <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" />Kumbele lya lipasiya lya uvili, kukali na kyumba kyekikemeliwe pono pang'alile hilo. <verse eid="HEB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" />Mumo kukali na kindangavala kya sahabu kwa kunyanyila manung'ililo na lisanduku lya lyagano, lyelikali libakilwe sahabu lubali chonda na mugati lyake mukali na kiviya kya sahabu kyekikali na kyakula kyekikemelwa mana na lusaga lwa Haluni yeikali ihomuwe mahamba na fila fibawo fyefisimbilwe malagilicho. <verse eid="HEB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" />Pakyanya lya lila lisanduko kukali na fiwumbe fivili fyefigehe na mapapatilo veviwonesa ukomi va Nguluvi, mapabatilo gyao gagubike kukyanya lya lugubikilo va sanduku. Ila nondee setuwesa kugahumulila kukyanya ga makani ago.<verse eid="HEB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />Ndeni, nde fivikilwe finu ifyo, ndeni vatekechi nde vakali vakwingila mukyumba kya kwanja na kuhecha usembe va kunyanya kila kigono. <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" />Ila mtekechi mkomi hela nde yeikwingila mukila kyumba lya uvili na mwene igita ndena mala yimwi hela kwa umwaka, akali ikwingila na danda yeakumhechela Nguluvi kwajili lya sambi chake na kwajili ya sambi chevagitile vanu. <verse eid="HEB 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" />Kuhumila na makani ago, Muhe va Nguluvi iwonesa wachi kuva, ng'asi lya kuhelela pono pang'alile hilo yave kudinduliwa kwa vanu vangi, kwakuva kyama kya pamwandi likali lyave. <verse eid="HEB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" />Njowo ichi ndi uwano va chipindi cha nondee, ambapo fupo na usembe va kunyanya chihechwa sechiwesa kumuhechelela sambi, <verse eid="HEB 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />ila ifi fyonda figagitilwe hela na fyakuliya na finywaji pamwi na malagicho gyonda gya kwiwogofecha kwa mvili ng'ani, ludali lwake wisila pala Nguluvi peakuvigita finu fyonda kuvecha.<verse eid="HEB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Ila Kilisito achile suwe na akivecha mtekechi mkomi va njowo manofu, gegiachile. Mwene igita kasi mukyama lingi, lyeligehe linofu hilo kangi ndi likamilifu kuchumba lila lya pamwandi. Kyama ilyo selichengilwe na vanu, ndeni kyama ilyo se lya inyi iyi. <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />Kilisito akaingiye pono pang'alile hilo mala yimwi hela. Seakaigiye na danda lya mene awu danda lya senga lya kuheche usembe va kunyanya, ila akaingiye kwa danda lyake yumwene, akatugaviye ulowola va mbepali. <verse eid="HEB 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" />Kwakuva, danda lya mene na likambako na kifu lya gwada vevamichilwe vala vanu sevadikilwe mukumgundamila Nguluvi, ung'alicha na kuvahechila uhafu va mivili gyao, <verse eid="HEB 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" />ila kwa danda lya Kilisto, igita makani makomi hilo! Kwa ludali lywa Muhe va Nguluvi, Kilisito ihechile yumwene litambiko kwa ludali lwa Muhe va Nguluvi yeagehe wumi, figono fyonda ifyo danda lyake ihogofecha numbula chetu chiveche nofu hilo kuhuma mumagito gyetu mawofu neke tumkumbanikile Nguluvi yeagehe wumi.<verse eid="HEB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />Kilisito ndi mnjengakaya va Lyagano limiya, neke vala vevakemeliwe vaveche kwanuka lyagano, kwakuva mwene akafuwe neke avakombole vanu musambi chevakagitile vanu mulyagano lya dahila.<verse eid="HEB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16" />Kwakuva, figono fyonda baluwa yeisimbilwe lya kuhala igita kasi pala hela yeasimbile afuwe. <verse eid="HEB 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17" />Gala geagalagiche givecha na ludali ngita lyagano lya kuhala lihela ludali ngita munu yealongile ave wumi. <verse eid="HEB 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />Ndeni, ata lila lyagano lya kwanja selikavikilwe ngajila danda. <verse eid="HEB 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" />Kwanja Musa akavalongiye vanu lagicho gyonda ngita pegikalongile. Baho akanyamule danda lya ngwada na mene na malenga, makwati gya libiki lya likongela na wusi mdung'u, akimichila kila kiganulo kya malagicho na akavamichile vanu vonda. <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" />Musa akalongile, “Iyi nde danda yeiwonesa kuva lyagano ilyi ndi lya undakyene yeavalagiliche Nguluvi mulidikile.” <verse eid="HEB 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" />Ndeni ndeni Musa akamichile yila danda mukyama na mufinu fyonda fya kumfunyila Nguluvi. <verse eid="HEB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" />Ndakyene kwa malagilicho gya Musa ngita fila kila kinu kogofya kwa danda na sambi chihechwa pala danda peisukuka.<verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Litambiko lwa Kilisito ihecha sambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />Finu ifi nde kimanyilo kya finu fya undakyene va kuluhano, ving'ang'wa fiwogofwe kwa danda. Ila finu fya kuluhano fing'ang'wa litambiko linofu hilo. <verse eid="HEB 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" />Kwakuva Kilisito seakaigie pono pang'alile hilo pepachengilwe kwa mawoko gya vanu, pepagehe ngita uwano pono pipene hilo. Mwene ikaingiye kuluhano kwa Nguluvi mwene, nondee akaimile pautalo lwa Nguluvi kwajili lya nefwe. <verse eid="HEB 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />Mtekechi mkomi va Vayawudi ikwingila pono pang'alile hilo kila mwaka kuno agehe na danda lya mng'oko, ila Kilisito seakaingiye umo neke ayiheche yumwene mala cholofu, <verse eid="HEB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" />ngita ngaivecha ndeni Kilisto ngaagudiswe mala chongofu kuhuma inyi peiwumbilwe kwakuva ngaiveche ndeni Kilisito ngaing'ang'ilwe kugudika mala chongofu. Ila nondee chipindi ichi cha mwiso, mwene ahumiye mala yimwi hela kuhecha sambi kwa litambiko va mvili vake. <verse eid="HEB 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />Ngita munu ufuwa mala yimwi hela, pambele ihigwa na Nguluvi, <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" />ndeni ndeni Kilisito ihechile litambiko mala yimwi hela neke kuvahechela sambi vanu volofu peikwacha kangi seikwacha kwajili lya sambi ila ikwacha kuvakombola vala vevakumhuvulila.<verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />Malagicho gya Musa ndi muwano va kinyigi kya njowo nofu dachechikwacha na sechiwana na njowo chila cha undakyene, matambiko galagala gegigitwa mwaka kwa mwaka, segiwesa ng'odo kuvang'alicha vanu vala vevakumgundamikila Nguluvi, <verse eid="HEB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />ngita avo vanu vevakumgundamikila Nguluvi ngavavang'alichwe sambi chawo ndakyene, ngasevayiwene kangi kuva vagehe na sambi na matambiko gala gyevakagahumiche ngavalekile. <verse eid="HEB 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3" />Ila matambiko ago gigitwa kila mwaka kuvawiwusa vanu sambi chawo. <verse eid="HEB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4" />Kwakuva, danda lya likambako na mene seiwesa kuvahechela vanu sambi.<verse eid="HEB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" />Ndeni kilisito peakali ikwacha muinyi, akamlongiye Nguluvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:5">“Seukasakile litambiko vala usembe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:5">ila ukandindalila muvili.<verse eid="HEB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />Veve sewikeleswa na litambiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:6">awu usembe va kuhecha sambi.<verse eid="HEB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />Baho ndikalongile, ‘Ndigehe baha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:7">eve Nguluvi, kugita gala gyeukela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:7">ngita pendisimbilwe nene mukiganulo kya malagilicho gya Musa.’” <verse eid="HEB 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />Akavangile kulonga, “Seukakeliye vala seukeleswa na litambiko vala usembe, tambiko cha kunyanywa na kuhecha sambi.” Akalongile ndeni ata ngita matambiko ago gyonda gakahechilwe kuwana na malagilicho ga Musa geagavilwe na Nguluvi. <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />Baho akalongile, “Ndigehe baha, kugita kyeusaka veve Nguluvi.” Ndeni, Nguluvi akaligalambule litambiko lya pamwandi na kuvika litambiko limwi. <verse eid="HEB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" />Kwakuva Yesu Kilisito akagitile gyeikela Nguluvi, nefwe tung'alichwa sambi chetu kwa yila litambiko lya muvili vake mwene yeahechile mala yimwi hela.<verse eid="HEB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />Kila mtekechi Muyawudi igita kasi lyake lya kiutekechi kila kigono na kuhecha matambiko galagala mala chongofu, ila matambiko ago segiwesa kuhecha sambi cha vanu. <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" />Ila Kilisito ihechile litambiko limwi kwakuva lya sambi, litambiko lya mbepali, ndeni akalile lubali lwa luwoko lwa ndewo lwa Nguluvi, <verse eid="HEB 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" />kuvangila chipindi icho akuchindila mbaka vachundwama vake avavike panyi lya magulu gyake ngita kinu kya kuvikila magulu gyake. <verse eid="HEB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />Suwe, kwakuva Kilisito ahichile kuva litambiko mala limwi, avang'aliche sambi chenu na kuvagita vanu vake mbepali.<verse eid="HEB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />Muhe va Nguluvi ndeni ndeni akutulongela njowo ichi. Tandi ilonga,<verse eid="HEB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" />“Iyi ndi lyagano lyedandigita na vao figono fyefikwacha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">Dandivika malagilicho gyangu munumbula chawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">na kuchisimba malagilicho gyangu muluhala chawo.”<verse eid="HEB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />Baho akalonga, “Dasendiwiwuka kangi sambi chawo vala magito gyawo mawofu.” <verse eid="HEB 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Suwe, sambi pechihechwa, kuhela kangi kuhecha litambiko lya kuhecha sambi.<verse eid="HEB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tumhegelele Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19" />Ndeni vakolo vangu, kwa danda lya Yesu tugangamichwe kwingila Pono Pang'alile ngajila wogofi. <verse eid="HEB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20" />Mwene katudindulile ng'asi miya, ng'asi yeikulongacha muwumi, kuchumbila lila lipasiya akagitile ndeni kwa kuuhecha muvili vake. <verse eid="HEB 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21" />Ndeni, tugehe na mtekechi mkomi yeihimilicha mukaye lya Nguluvi. <verse eid="HEB 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22" />Suwe, tumuhegelele Nguluvi kwa numbula nofu na kwa ludikilo lwa undakyene, tukivecha na numbula cheching'alichwe kuhumila na natilo njanganifu na mivili gyetu giwogofechwe kwa malenga manofu. <verse eid="HEB 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" />Tulikolele luhuvililo lwetu lwe tukuuidikila na lye tukulilonga kwa milomo gyetu, kwakuva Nguluvi yeavikile lyagano lyake nde va undakyene. <verse eid="HEB 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />Tung'ang'wa kugangamilichana numbula neke tukelane na kwigitila manofu nefwe kwa nefwe. <verse eid="HEB 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" />Tubihile kuleka kutang'ana pamwi, ngita ndeni vangi pevalekile kutang'ana. Ila tung'ang'wa kutangana, ngita pemulola kigono kya Mtwa kigehe pepi. <verse eid="HEB 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />Ngita tukwendelela kugita sambi kwa dadi hela kuno tuchela undakyene, suwe kuhela litambiko lyelivecha kuhechwa kangi kwajili lya kuhecha sambi cha vanu. <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" />Ila kyekisigala ndi kuchinda kwa wogofi kuhigwa na Nguluvi kwa lyoto daukuvadocha vonda vevakumkana Nguluvi. <verse eid="HEB 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" />Munu yeyonda yekana malagilicho ga Musa geagavilwe na Nguluvi, udochwa ngajila kuwonelwa lusungu ikiva kugehe na vaswida va vanu vavili awu vadatu. <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" />Mulola wuli, munu yula yeakumbeba Mwana va Nguluvi na kuilola danda lya lyagano lya Nguluvi yeimung'aliche sambi se kinu na daipatila lihigo liki? Na yeamulige Muhe va Nguluvi daipatila lihigo liki? <verse eid="HEB 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" />Kwakuva, tuchela kuva Nguluvi akalongile, “Kasi lya kupilusa ndi lyangu, dandipilusa kila kyevagitile, nene dandikuvapilusila vao.” Ndeni ndeni akalongile, “Daakuvahiga vanu vake.” <verse eid="HEB 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" />Ndi lukani lwa kogofya hilo kutang'ana na lihigo kuhuma kwa Nguluvi yeagehe wumi!<verse eid="HEB 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />Muwiwuke gyegahumie figono fila fya pamwandi pemudikile Kilisito ata ngita mkagudile hilo, ila nyenye mukahuvilile. <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" />Kigono kingi mukaligilwe na kubedelwa pautalo lya van, kwa chipindi chingi mukavatangile vala vevagudiswe ngita nyenye. <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" />Mukavawonela lusungu vala vevakali mukiwopo, mkaidikile kwa lukeduko pemkanyagilwe finu fyenu, kwakuva mukali mwichela munumba chenu mugehe na finu finofu hilo, dafivecha mbepali. <verse eid="HEB 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />Ndena, mubihile kuyagicha ukakatima venu kwa Mtwa, kwakuva likuvaletela fupo ngomi kuhuma kwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="HEB 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" />Mwing'ang'wa kuvecha na luhuvililo neke mugite gala gyeing'ang'a Nguluvi na kwanuka gala gyeavalongiye. <verse eid="HEB 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" />Kwakuva, isimbilwe Mumasimbo gya Nguluvi kuva,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:37">“Kisigiye chipindi kidodo hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:37">na uyo yeikwacha, daikwacha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:37">na seikawiya.<verse eid="HEB 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" />Ila munu vangu yeigita gyegikunikelesa daakwikala kwa kunidikila nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:38">ila ngita ikogofya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:38">nene sendikeduswa na mwene.”<verse eid="HEB 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />Suwe, nefwe setugehe ngita vanu vevileka kumfwatila Nguluvi na kuyaga, ila tugehe pamwi na vanu vevidikila na kulowolwa.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="s">Kumudikila Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />Kumudikila Nguluvi ndi kuvecha na undakyene kuva makani gegituhuvilila dagigitwa. Kangi ndikuhuvilila hilo makani ambago segatugalola nondee. <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" />Kwa ng'asi ilyo lya kumdikila Nguluvi, vagogolo vetu vakamkelesa hilo Nguluvi.<verse eid="HEB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" />Kwa kudikila tuchela kuva inyi ikawumbilwe kwa luchowo lwa Nguluvi, ndeni finu fyefiwoneka fiwumbilwe kuhuma mufinu sefiwoneka.<verse eid="HEB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />Kwa kudikila kwa Abeli akamhechela Nguluvi litambiko lyelikali linofu hilo kuchumba yila lya Kaini. Kwa kudikila kwa mwene, Nguluvi akamdikile kuva msanzi pautalo lyake. Nguluvi yumwene akachidikile litambiko lyake. Ila kwa kudikila kwake, ata ngita Abeli afuwe. Kudikila kwa mwene, iendelela kuvecha mufano mnofu kwa nefwe mbaka neng'uli.<verse eid="HEB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" />Kwa kumudikila Nguluvi kukamugitile Enoki anyamuliwe kuhelela kuluhano, ndeni seafuwe. Seakawonike kangi kwakuva Nguluvi akamnyamuwe kuhelela kuluhano. Masimbo ga Nguluvi giwonesa peave seanyamuliwe kuhelela kuluhano kwa Nguluvi, Enoki akali munu yeakumkelisa Nguluvi. <verse eid="HEB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" />Kwihela yeyonda yeiwesa kumkelesa Nguluvi ngajila kumudikila Nguluvi. Kwakuva munu yeyonda yeakumuheleliya Nguluvi ing'ang'wa adikile kuva Nguluvi poyuli na kuvagavila fupo vala vevakumsaka kwa kugangamala.<verse eid="HEB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" />Kwa kudikila kwa Nuhu ikamugitile kupulikicha, pealakilwe na Nguluvi kutigila makani gala dagikwacha pambele, gala gesegiwoneka. Baho akagelaniche safina, neke Nguluvi avalowe mwene pamwi na vakolo vake. Na kuvahiga vanu muinyi vevakali sevamwidikile Nguluvi. Kwakuva lya ilyo, Nuhu akagitilwe kuva msanzi pautalo lya Nguluvi. <verse eid="HEB 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" />Kwa kudikila kwa mwene Ibulahimu ikamugitile amupulikiche Nguluvi pala peamulongile ahege muinyi lyake, ahele muinyi daakumgavila iveche lyake. Na akahegile muinyi lyake na seakachelile peakuhelela. <verse eid="HEB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" />Kwa kudikila kwa mwene Ibulahimu akakalile ngita mgenji mu inyi yealongilwe daigavilwa na Nguluvi. Akakalile ukoya mukyama ngita pevakalile Isaka na Yakobo, avo navo vakawanuke gala gala gealongile Nguluvi. <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />Kwakuva, Ibulahimu akali ichindila mwani ambalyo kitamiko lwake kichengilwe na Nguluvi, mwani ambago Nguluvi yumwene akahochile na kuuchenga.<verse eid="HEB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" />Kwa kudikila kwa mwene Ibulahimu akali Daada ata ngita akali mgogolo hilo, ndeni ndeni Sala akali mgumba. Ibulahimu akamdikile Nguluvi kuva daigita kila kyealongile dakumgavila. <verse eid="HEB 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" />Ndeni, Ibulahimu akali mgogolo ngita munu yeafuwe, ndeni kuhuma kwa munu uyu yumwi vakababilwe vanu volofu vesevivalilwa ngita nondwa cha kuluhano na muhanga va mung'umbu muinyinza.<verse eid="HEB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" />Vanu ava vonda vakafuwe kuno vakwimdikila Nguluvi. Vakafuwe kuno vave sevawanuke gala gevalongilwe na Nguluvi, ila kwa utali vakagawona vakahekelela na kudikila wachi kuva vao vakali vagenji na vevagehe muligendo muinyi iyi. <verse eid="HEB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Vanu vevilonga makani ngita aga, viwoneka visaka inyi lyawo vavene. <verse eid="HEB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />Ngita ngavivecha vihocha inyi yevahumile dahila, vangepatile fwasi lwa kuwuya kuko. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" />Ila nondee vakuikela inyi inofu hilo, inyi lya kuluhano kwa Nguluvi. Ndeni, Nguluvi seiwona nyoni pevakumkemela Nguluvi vao, kwakuva mwene avaandalile mwani vao.<verse eid="HEB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17" />Ibulahimu kwa kumudikila Nguluvi, ikamugitile adikile kumuhecha litambiko mwana vake Isaka peagechilwe na Nguluvi. Ibulahimu yumwene nde yeakawanuke kila kyealongilwe na Nguluvi, ila ata ndeni, akadikile kumuhecha litambiko mwana vake vaweka, <verse eid="HEB 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18" />ila Nguluvi akali amulongile Ibulahimu, “Kuchumbila Isaka daupata ulelo.” <verse eid="HEB 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" />Ibulahimu akadikile kuva Nguluvi iwesa kuvachulubucha vanu vevafuwe, iyi ngita fila Ibulahimu akamwanuka Isaka kuhuma kwa vanu vevafuwe.<verse eid="HEB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />Kwakuva kwa kudikila kwa Isaka ikamugitile avanemele Yakobo na Esau, vawanuke lunemelo lwelukwacha pambele.<verse eid="HEB 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" />Kwa kudikila kwa Yakobo peakali pepi kufuwa, kukamugitile avanemele vana vavili va Yusufu na kumgundamikila Nguluvi kuno asagamiye lusaga lwake.<verse eid="HEB 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" />Kwa kudikila kwa Yusufu peakali pepi kufuwa, kukamugitile alonge njowo cha Vaisilaeli kuhuma ku Misili, akavalagiche vaigite liki michege gyake.<verse eid="HEB 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />Kwa kudikila kwa vasasi va Musa kukavagita vakamfyamile Musa kwa myechi gidatu kuhuma peababilwe. Vakamwene kuva akali mwana mnofu, vala sevakaogwipe malagilicho ga ng'achale va ku Misili.<verse eid="HEB 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" />Kwa kudikila Musa kukamugitile peakulile, akakanile kukemelwa mwana va mhinja Falao. <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />Akawene ndi ngiba kugudika pamwi na vanu va Nguluvi kuchumba kukedukila sambi kwa chipindi chidodo. <verse eid="HEB 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" />Achele kuva kumgudikila Kilisito ndi umosi mkomi hilo kuchumba umosi vonda va inyi lya Misili, kwakuva akali ichindila fupo daigavilwa na Nguluvi.<verse eid="HEB 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" />Kwa kudikila kwa Musa kukamugita ahege kuhuma inyi lya Misili ngajila kogofya luvipo lwa ng'achale na seawuyile kumbele kwakuva akali ngita munu yeamuwonile Nguluvi yeseawoneka. <verse eid="HEB 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" />Kwa kudikila akagitile lihungu lya Pasaka, akalagiliche danda imichwe pamisimbili, neke Ndumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi yeidocha abihile kuvadocha vababwa va ulongola va Isilaeli.<verse eid="HEB 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" />Kwa kudikila, vanu va Isilaeli vakahagime inyanza lya Shamu ngita inyi ng'afu, ila Vamisili pevakagechile kuhagama vakafuwe mumalenga.<verse eid="HEB 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" />Kwa kudikila lukanji lwa mwani va Yeliko chikaguwe, pevachichungutile vanu va Isilaeli kwa figono saba. <verse eid="HEB 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" />Kwa kudikila kwa Lahabu mkidala yeakali mgoni kukamugitile, seakadochilwe pamwi na vala vevakali vamulemile Nguluvi, kwakuva akavawanuke vala vevalagichwe kulolesa inyi lyao.<verse eid="HEB 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />Wuli, ndilonge liki kangi? Ndihela muda va kuhumulila makani gya Gidioni na gya Balaka na gya Samusoni na gya Yafita na gya Dawudi na gya Samweli na gya vavichi va Nguluvi. <verse eid="HEB 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" />Kwa kudikila vonda avo vakatovine na vang'achale na vakavatova. Na vakagitile makani gya usanzi, vakawanuke gala gyeavalongie Nguluvi. Vakadindile milomo gya simba, <verse eid="HEB 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" />vakachimile myoto ming'ali, vakananile kudochwa kwa mipanga. Pevakali vasosuvafu vagavilwe ludali, vakali na ludali mufita, vakavatova vapuga vagenji. <verse eid="HEB 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" />Na vadala yevidikiye vakawuyisilwe valongu vawo vevachulubuchwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 11:35">Vamonga vawo vakalimile kuvopolwa, vakagudiswa mbaka kufuwa neke vachulubuke na kwingila muuwumi veugehe nofu hilo. <verse eid="HEB 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" />Vangi vakabedilwe na kutovwa ndomondo, vangi vakawopilwe ndegeyi cha kyuma na kutagwa mukiwopo. <verse eid="HEB 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" />Vakafuwe kwa kutovwa maganga, vakabachuliwe fipande fivili kwa sege, vakadochilwe kwa mipanga. Vakachungutile kuno na kuno vakiva vafwalile gwembe cha ng'ondolo na gwembe awu cha mene, vakali vanu vahangala, vagudiswe na kugitwa makani manjanganifu. <verse eid="HEB 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />Vanu va inyi seavakuvakela kuvecha na vanu vasanzi ngita ava. Kwa ndeni, vanu avo vakali vichunguta chunguta mudasi na fidunda, vakalile mumanga na mulilindi.<verse eid="HEB 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />Vanu ava vonda vakampendesile Nguluvi, kwakuva kwa kudikila kwa vene. Ila kwihela ata yumwi yeawanuke gala gegajangilwe na Nguluvi, <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />seavapatile ago, kwakuva Nguluvi atuvikile makani manofu hilo, neke nefwe pamwi na vene, tugawanuke ago ambagyo Nguluvi agajangile kuva daakutugavila.<verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="s">Nguluvi ndi Daada vetu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />Nefwe tuchungutilwe na lipinga likomi lya vaswida. Ndeni kuheche kila kinu kyekitukanila na sambi yila yetung'ang'anila, tunyile kwa luhuvililo mumasindano gyetuvikilwe. <verse eid="HEB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" />Tumfutuliye meho Yesu yetumdikila kuhuma pamwandi mbaka kumwiso. Kwakuva lya lukeduko yeikali ikumchindila akahuvilile kipindilihicho, seakawonile nyoni kipindilihicho na nondee akalile lubali lwa liwoko lwa ndewo lwa kigoda kya ung'achale kya Nguluvi.<verse eid="HEB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />Muhoche njowo chechimpatile Yesu, peahuvilile kuhigwa na vanu vene sambi, suwe mubihile kufwahila na mubihile kudenyeka numbula. <verse eid="HEB 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />Ingava mkwitasa semwitovile kwa nyenye na sambi, nyenye semugudike mbaka kudochwa. <verse eid="HEB 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" />Wuli musemwile makani aga ga kugangamicha numbula gyealongile Nguluvi kuva nyenye ndi vana vake?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:5">“Mwana vangu, ubihile kubeda Mtwa peakulakilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:5">Baho peakulakilila bihile kudenyeka numbula.<verse eid="HEB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />Kwakuva Mtwa humulakalila munu yeyonda yeakumkela mwene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:6">na kumukanila munu yeyonda yeakumdikila kuva mwana vake.”<verse eid="HEB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />Muhuvilile pala pemukanilwa Nguluvi akuvagitila nyenye ngita vana vake. Wuli ndi mwana liki yeseikanilwa na daada vake. <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />Ila Nguluvi akuvahiga vana vake vonda, ngita Nguluvi dasevakuvahiga muchele kuva nyenye se vana vake, ila ndi vana va mung'asi. <verse eid="HEB 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />Kangi kuhumila na ago, nefwe vonda tugehe na vadaada vetu vevatubabile vevakutukanila na nefwe tukuvadikila. Suwe, setung'ang'wa kumuginya hilo Daada vetu va kuluhano neke tuwese kwikala mbepali?. <verse eid="HEB 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />Vadaada vetu yevatubabile vakutukanila kwa figono fidodo ngita pevawona vene ndi unofu. Ila Nguluvi akutukanila kwa kututanga nefwe na tuveche vang'alila ngita mwene. <verse eid="HEB 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" />Kwihela munu yeakukedukila kutovwa, ila liletila lusugwimo. Ila vanu vevayiwulaniche kuva na kyanda nofu kwa ng'asi lya kutovwa, vakwikala kwa lutengamaso na kugita makani gegidikilwa pautali lwa Nguluvi.<verse eid="HEB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawulanicho na malakilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />Suwe, mugangamiche mawoko gyenu gyegifwahile na mafugamilo gyenu gasosovafu. <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" />Mwendelele kugenda mung'asi yeigolike na yeagehe mtenda abihile kusilila ludali, ananichwe.<verse eid="HEB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" />Mwigangamale kwikala kwa lutengamaso na vanu vonda na kwikala kutali na sambi kwakuva kuhela munu dayeakumwona Mtwa ngajila kwikala ndeni. <verse eid="HEB 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" />Mwigangamale hilo munu yeyonda abihile kupwemuka usanzi va Nguluvi. Mwilolele munu yeyonda abihile kuwana na lidede kwa lya libiki lng'ali na kulembula na kuvagudisa vangi kwa sumu lyake. <verse eid="HEB 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" />Mwilolele neke mugati lyenu pabihile kuvecha na munu mgoni awu munu yeseamkogopa Nguluvi ngita Esawu yeakaguchile uhala va ubabwa va ulongolo kwa kyakuliya kimwi. <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" />Nyenye mwichela kuva ata pambele peasakile kupata kangi wula lunemelo weukali vake akakanilwe, kwakuva seweseile kugalambula kwa kila kyeagitile ata ngita akasakile hilo kwa mahochi.<verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />Nyenye semukafikile kidunda Sinai ngita pevafikile vanu va Isilaeli. Kidunda kyekiweswa kukolelwa kuno wikwaka lyoto wene lifunde lisito na kisi na lukala lwelupuga hilo, <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" />na kyowo kya lingalapi na vakapulike Nguluvi akilonga. Vanu vala vevampulike Nguluvi akilonga, vakasukile vabihile kuywanga nave kwa ng'asi ilyo, <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" />sevawesile kuwanuka malagicho geihechilwe, “Dayeikolela kidunda iki, ata ngita ndi mng'oko, daitovwa na maganga mbaka afuwe.” <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" />Ago gyonda gavagitile vakogope hilo, mbaka Musa akalongile, “Ndikogopa hilo na kuhilima.”<verse eid="HEB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" />Ila nyenye mfikile kidunda cha Siyoni mumwani va Nguluvi yeagehe wumi, mufikile Yelusalemu mumwani va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi pamwi na vandumindumi volofu seviweswa kuvalilwa. <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" />Mufikile mulipinga lya vanu vevamdikile Nguluvi va kwanja, matawa gyawo gasimbilwe kuluhano. Mwachile kwa Nguluvi yeihiga vanu vonda na muhe cha vanu vevamukelesa Nguluvi vevagitilwe vang'alila. <verse eid="HEB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" />Mwachile kwa Yesu mupatanisi vanu na Nguluvi mudanda yeisukwike kuchumba yila lya Abeli.<verse eid="HEB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />Suwe, mwilolele mubihile kukana kumpulikicha uyo yeilonga. Ngita vanu vala vevalemile kumpulikicha yula yeavalakile baha painyi sevalowike, nefwe twiwesa wuli kulowoka ngita tukana kumpulikicha yula yeakutulakila kuhuma kuluhano kwa Nguluvi? <verse eid="HEB 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" />Chipindi kila lichwi ikahogoseka inyi chipindi kila, ila nondee atulongiye, “Dandihogosesa kangi mala yimwi inyi, neke kutuwonesa finu fyonda fyefiwumbilwe muinyi dafihongesekwa na kufihecha ila fisigala fila sefihongeseka.” <verse eid="HEB 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />Luchowo ulu ambalyo likalongile kangi, liwonesa kuva finu fyonda fyeawumbile Nguluvi muinyi dafihogoseka na kuhega kuyaganika neke fisigale fila seviwesa kuhogosekwa.<verse eid="HEB 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />Ndena, nefwe tuhongeche, kwakuva tuwanuke ung'achale weseuhogoseka. Tuveche na luhongecho na kumgumbanikila kwa kumkelesa na kumpulikicha na kwa kumukogopa, <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" />kwakuva Nguluvi vetu ndakyene ndi lyoto mkali weuhanangicha.<verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="s">Twiwesa wuli kumkelasa Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />Mwendelele kukelana ngita peing'ang'wa kwa vanu vevamudikile Kilisito. <verse eid="HEB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" />Mubihile kusemuwa kuvawanuka vagenji mukaye lyenu, kwa kugita ndena vanu vangi vapatile kuvawanuka vandumindumi va kuluhanao kwa Nguluvi ngajila kuchela. <verse eid="HEB 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" />Muvawiwuke vala vevawopilwe ngita fila muwopilwe navo. Muvaviwuke vala vevigudiswa ngita ndeni na nyenye mwiguda ngita vawo.<verse eid="HEB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />Ndova, ying'ang'wa kuginywa na vanu vonda, mgosi na mdala vabihile kuvasa na vanu vangi. Nguluvi daakuvahiga vagoni na vapeji.<verse eid="HEB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" />Mubihile kudoboka sendi, mugwite na finu fyemnafyo. Kwakuva Nguluvi akalongile, “Sendikuleka ng'odo vala sendikutaga ng'odo.” <verse eid="HEB 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" />Ndeni, nde kwakuva tuwesa kulonga ngajila uogofi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:6">“Mtwa nde yeakunitanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:6">sendikogopa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:6">Wuli munu akunigita liki?”<verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />Muvawiwuke filongosi venu vevawulaniche luchowo lwa Nguluvi. Muvawiwuke pevakalile na pevafuwe, mwiwane navo pevavamudikiye Nguluvi. <verse eid="HEB 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" />Yesu Kilisito ndi yula yula, golo na neng'uli na mbepali. <verse eid="HEB 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" />Mubihile kunyamuliwa na mawulanicho gangi gegakuvagita muhelele kuno na kuno. Kwakuva, numbula chenu ching'ang'wa chigangamalichwe kwa usanzi va Nguluvi, sekukolela malagilicho gya fyakuliya, kwakuva malagilicho ago segavatangile vala vanu vevafwatile.<verse eid="HEB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />Nefwe tugehe na kindangavala kya kumgundamikila Nguluvi, mumo vala vatekechi vevigita kasi mukyama lya kutang'anila Vayawudi, seving'ang'wa kuliya usembe veuhechilwe. <verse eid="HEB 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" />Mtekechi mkomi isindika danda lya vang'oko mupono pang'alile hilo na kuihecha ngita litambiko kwakuva lya sambi, ila wuchi va vang'oko avo unyanywa kwivala lya kambi. <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" />Nde kwakuva, Yesu akagudile na kufuwa kwivala lya mwani neke avang'aliche vanu kwa danda lyake yumwene. <verse eid="HEB 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" />Suwe, tumuheleliye kwivala lya kambi, tukaligwe ngita pealigilwe mwene. <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" />Kwakuva baha painyi twihela mwani vewikala mbepali, ila tukuuchindila wula weukwacha. <verse eid="HEB 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" />Suwe, kuchumbila Yesu, tumuhechele Nguluvi litambiko lya kumnjuma mbepali. Kwakuva Njowo chetu cha kujma litawa lyake nde ngita tambiko vetu ve tukumuhechela. <verse eid="HEB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" />Muendelele kutanga vayenu kwa finu fyemunafyo, mukigita ndeni, nde litambiko lyelikumkelesa Nguluvi.<verse eid="HEB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />Muvapulikiche filongochi venu na kukolela geakuvalagilicha, vao vakwihecha kwajili lyenu ngajila kutulula na ving'ang'wa kuhumulila kasi lyao pautalo lya Nguluvi. Pemukuvapulikicha davigita kasi chawo kwa lukeduko, ngita dasemukuvapulikicha davigita kasi chawo kwa kusugwima, ndeni lukani ulo daselikuvatanga nyenye.<verse eid="HEB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" />Mutusukile kwa Nguluvi. Ndakyene tuchela kuva numbula chetu sechituwonesa kuva tukosiye, kwakuva twigangamala kugita gegagehe manofu kwa vanu vonda. <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />Ndikuvasuka hilo, munisukile neke Nguluvi andiwuyise kwa nyenye kisato.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lusuko lwa kumalila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20" />Nguluvi yeamchulubuche Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito, mwene ndi Mtekechi Mkomi va kondolo, kwakuva kwa kusukula danda lyake yeiwonesa lyagano lya kigono kyonda ndi lya undakyene, <verse eid="HEB 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21" />Nguluvi avagavile ludali lwa kugita geakukela Nguluvi. Kangi, agite munumbula chenu makani gyonda gegikumkelesa, kwa ng'asi lya Yesu Kilisito. Mwene anjumwe figono fyonda fyefihela mwiso. Ndakyene.<verse eid="HEB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makani gya kumalila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />Vakolo vangu, ndikuvasuka hilo muveche mukugafwatila njowo ichi cha kuvagangamicha numbula, ambagyo gendisimbile mubaluwa iyi kwa udodo. <verse eid="HEB 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />Ndisaka muchele kuva mkolo vetu Timoteo ahechiliwe kuhuma mukihopo. Ngita daikwacha kwa nene kisatu, suwe dandikwacha na mwene kuvalola.<verse eid="HEB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />Muvahungile filongochi venu vonda pamwi na vanu vevemudikiye Kilisito! Vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito va inyi lya Italiya vakuvahungila.<verse eid="HEB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />Tukumsukila Nguluvi aendelele kuvagavila usangi vake nyenye vonda.<verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>